WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:02.839
Give your AI agent access to your inbox.

2
00:00:02.839 --> 00:00:05.519
Works with Gmail, iCloud, Fastmail, or the

3
00:00:05.519 --> 00:00:07.599
IMAP mailbox you already have.

4
00:00:07.599 --> 00:00:09.769
It takes about one minute and it looks

5
00:00:09.769 --> 00:00:10.560
like this.

6
00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.599
First, I'm picking my provider.

7
00:00:12.599 --> 00:00:14.400
I'll go with plain IMAP.

8
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.859
Then I brought in the address, the two

9
00:00:16.859 --> 00:00:18.460
host names, and a password that's

10
00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:20.039
encrypted before it's stored.

11
00:00:20.039 --> 00:00:22.519
Now, it's connecting directly to my mail

12
00:00:22.519 --> 00:00:23.960
server live.

13
00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:27.120
That means my agent can reach my inbox.

14
00:00:27.309 --> 00:00:30.079
Claude, ChatGPT, or an example agent like

15
00:00:30.079 --> 00:00:30.920
this one.

16
00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:33.520
I ask it, what actually needs me today?

17
00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:35.679
It goes through my inbox and finds one

18
00:00:35.679 --> 00:00:37.479
invoice that's overdue.

19
00:00:37.479 --> 00:00:39.240
The rest can wait.

20
00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:41.719
No emails are stored anywhere.

21
00:00:41.719 --> 00:00:44.640
It reads from your provider every time.

22
00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:46.880
So that's MCP Emails.

23
00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.840
Give your AI agent an inbox.
